    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a pointing constraint of one axis of the spacecraft towards a user defined pointing vector generator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Unlike the pre-defined target types above, the target is fully user defined: the pointing vector is generated at each timestep by a function that returns a vector in the ECI frame (does not need to be known beforehand). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
